"entity": {
"name": "Stagwell, Inc.",
"description": "Stagwell, Inc. operates as media and public relations agency. The firm provides marketing and business solutions including creative services, communications strategy, digital transformation, experiences, technology solutions, market research, media and commerce services, and software-as-a-service and data-as-a-service products. It operates through the following reportable segments: Marketing Services, Digital Transformation, Media & Commerce, Communications, and The Marketing Cloud. The Marketing Services segment provides creative, research, experiential, and social media services. The Digital Transformation segment provides digital transformation, technology, and related services. The Media & Commerce segment provides media, commerce, performance marketing, and related services. The Communications segment provides strategic communications, public relations, public affairs, advocacy, investor relations, and related services. The Marketing Cloud segment provides SaaS and DaaS products and technology-enabled marketing solutions. The company was founded on April 29, 2011 and is headquartered in New York, NY.",
